---
---
<section class="relative min-h-[90vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-anime-dark pt-24 pb-16">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 speed-lines opacity-40 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-anime-dark/40 to-anime-dark"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-b from-anime-purple/20 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <p class="font-noto text-anime-cyan text-sm md:text-base mb-4 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">
      忍 • SEO AGENCY PHILIPPINES
    </p>

    <h1 class="font-bangers text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl text-white leading-none mb-6 drop-shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(255,45,85,0.45)]">
      SEO services in the<br />
      <span class="text-anime-pink">Philippines</span>, trained<br />
      like a shinobi
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Shinobi SEO is a Quezon City SEO company for Manila, Cebu, Davao and nationwide brands that need search demand, not slogans.
      We are a studio of <a href="https://brightforgeseo.com" class="text-anime-cyan underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-anime-pink">Bright Forge SEO</a>,
      the parent agency behind the missions.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="px-8 py-4 bg-anime-pink text-white font-bangers text-xl rounded-xl border-4 border-black shadow-[6px_6px_0_#00F5FF] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_#00F5FF] hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 transition-all"
      >
        Start Your Ranking Quest
      </a>
      <a
        href="/services"
        class="px-8 py-4 bg-transparent text-anime-cyan font-bangers text-xl rounded-xl border-4 border-anime-cyan hover:bg-anime-cyan hover:text-anime-dark transition-all"
      >
        Explore Our Techniques
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex justify-center">
      <div
        class="w-40 h-40 md:w-52 md:h-52 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-anime-purple via-anime-pink to-anime-cyan border-8 border-black shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(255,45,85,0.4)] flex items-center justify-center text-6xl md:text-7xl"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        🥷
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
